The module structure, operation order and numerics implemented in chai1_eager/trunk.py, and the TorchScript sources executed by
chai1_eager/ts2eager.py, are read from the exported TorchScript archives distributed by Chai Discovery (models_v2/*.pt). No weights are
included in this package; they are loaded at run time from the user's chai-lab download directory (CHAI_DOWNLOADS_DIR).

Kernels this package can bind at run time (not bundled in this directory):
  NVIDIA cuEquivariance (cuequivariance_torch) — its own licence, installed from NVIDIA's distribution;
